{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0JvbGx5d29vZC8yMDExLTIwMTUvRG9vc3VrZWx0aGElMjAlMjgyMDEzJTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Doosukeltha","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/e4iXfQOGdD7iTNkiMUkc4bPGmPw.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6lzUSTtISNJC3NVxjEqZkZiGPDa.jpg","description":"Chinna (Vishnu) is a very witty and resourceful person who knows how to get things done. As kids, Chinna and Piccheshwar (Vennela Kishore) have a tiff and Piccheshwar leaves the village in a huff. Piccheshwar’s outraged grandfather (Kota Srinivasa Rao) orders the execution of Chinna’s family, forcing them to flee as well.  As the years go by, Chinna grows into a tall and fearless young fellow. He applies for a job as a journalist and he is sent on an assignment by his boss Avatar (Posani). The assignment is to conduct a sting operation on Minister Dilleeswara Rao (Pankaj Tripathi). Chinna succeeds in capturing incriminating footage, but he is caught and thrashed by the minister’s goons.","releaseInfo":"2013","genres":["Comedy","Drama","Bollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.7","runtime":"150 min","cast":["Vishnu Manchu","Lavanya Tripathi","Brahmanandam","Ahuti Prasad","Kota Srinivasa Rao","Rao Ramesh","Bharat","Pankaj Tripathi"],"director":["Veeru Potla"],"released":"2013-10-17T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Vishnu Manchu","character":"Venkateshwar/ Chinna/ Venky/ Venkanna","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/g0wi6kP54JK2B1312pwiEexihFB.jpg"},{"name":"Lavanya Tripathi","character":"Alekhya/ Chinni","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/pSImZMZmcShcT1zZ7LBXk5ISwLX.jpg"},{"name":"Brahmanandam","character":"Veera Brahmam","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/zh6nWEIy3l1dsZA9EDuDezq867b.jpg"},{"name":"Ahuti Prasad","character":"Chinna's father","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/z0Al1VOH1O45uDQCXt6kadn9psR.jpg"},{"name":"Kota Srinivasa Rao","character":"Rajeshwar, Alekhya's Grandfather","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t